# Dantooine, the crystal (kinrath) cave and back (TSL, 604DAN, 601DAN,
# 602DAN): the atmospheric sensors in the rubble by the entrance (Bao-Dur
# on them; no Awareness or Repair to open one), Ahrnell the rock-collecting
# mercenary (apologised to, left with his gland: DSimpson's every way to it
# is dark), Kreia on the cave's memories, a crystal formation disturbed:
# the Matriarch and her brood fought (Zherron's job brings her), her remains,
# the formations and the Exile's own crystal (Kreia's talk on it); back to
# Saedhe (the surveillance found, the sensors left him for 3000: LSP) and
# to Zherron for the job's 2000 credits. Starts from the plains' checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_plains data/routes/tsl/dantooine_cave.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Crystal/Kinrath Cave" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit To_604
module 604dan
say You don't know about what? The sensors? # the rubble: the three
say [Awareness] Can you examine one of the sensors? # sensors; Bao-Dur, asked
say Good work Bao Dur # by the Exile's [Awareness], finds surveillance
use cont_sensor      # gear in them (+INF)
to tr_cont_cv
talk
say My apologies.    # Ahrnell: no gland asked
say I'm just exploring
say I'll be going now.
use g_merc_pat
talk
to tr_kreia_crystal  # Kreia: the crystals hold the Force, Revan passed here
talk
use cryform_bl@1     # a formation disturbed: the Matriarch and her brood
fight 60             # (she comes for one given Zherron's kinrath job)
use g_kinrath_mom    # her remains
use cryform_bl@2     # the other formations
use cryform_bl@3
use crystal_cont     # the Exile's own crystal: Kreia's talk on it
talk
exit To_601
module 601dan
say Actually, I've found three of them. # Saedhe: caught out on the
say Not so fast - we found a little surprise # surveillance, and the light
say Why is there surveillance equipment # way: he keeps the sensors for
say You need the credits more than me # 3000 credits (LSP, DSimpson)
use npc_saedhe
talk
exit To_602
module 602dan
say I cleared out the kinrath cave. # Zherron's reward (2000)
use npc_zherron
talk
exit To_601
module 601dan
save dantooine_rewards
